ng in 599ed722 on notes/2026-08-24-multi-workroom.md:135-145, which now states the reverse of what main does. The artifact there is mine so I have the authority, but your conditions named architecture and CLI documentation and that is a dated design note. It stays deliberately unfixed until you say."}